---
import Base from '@/templates/Base.astro';
---

<Base head={{ title: 'Privacy | WeiKnight', description: 'Privacy information for the WeiKnight personal site.' }} theme='real'>
  <main class='mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-5 py-12 font-formal-sans text-real-text sm:py-16'>
    <a href='/' class='text-sm text-real-accent hover:underline'>← Home</a>
    <article class='prose prose-base prose-invert prose-slate mt-10 max-w-none prose-headings:font-black prose-a:text-real-accent prose-strong:text-white md:prose-lg'>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated: August 25, 2026</strong></p>
      <p>This page explains the limited information processed when you use this personal website.</p>

      <h2>Information processed</h2>
      <p>Accounts are created by the administrator; public registration is not available. The server stores the username, display name, optional biography, authorization role, password hash, account status, and optional uploaded avatar needed to provide authenticated access and account profiles.</p>
      <p>After login, the site uses a session cookie to keep you signed in. The cookie is used only for authentication and is not used for advertising or cross-site tracking.</p>
      <p>The web server may record ordinary technical logs such as request time, requested path, IP address, browser information, and response status for operation and security troubleshooting.</p>

      <h2>How information is used</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To authenticate users and protect restricted content.</li>
        <li>To operate, secure, diagnose, and maintain the website.</li>
        <li>To manage content uploaded by administrators.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This site does not sell personal information and does not use personal information for targeted advertising.</p>

      <h2>Storage and security</h2>
      <p>Account data and managed content are stored on the site server. Passwords are stored as one-way hashes rather than plain text. Access is limited according to account roles.</p>
      <p>No internet service can guarantee absolute security. Software, access controls, and deployment configuration are maintained to reduce avoidable risk.</p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>This site may link to external services. Their own privacy policies apply when you leave this site.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You may ask the administrator to review, disable, or delete your account. Session data can also be removed from your browser by logging out or clearing site cookies.</p>

      <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
      <p>This policy may be updated when site functionality or hosting practices change. Questions can be sent to <a href='mailto:weiknight0@outlook.com'>weiknight0@outlook.com</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
